      "light-gray":      { "hover": { "hex": "#03091A", "opacity": "5%", "hex8": "#03091A0D" }, "pressed": { "hex": "#03091A", "opacity": "10%", "hex8": "#03091A1A" }, "hover-inverse": { "hex": "#FDFDFD", "opacity": "10%" }, "pressed-inverse": { "hex": "#FDFDFD", "opacity": "20%" }, "sameHexAs": "ref-color-gray-900 (hover/pressed), ref-color-gray-50 (hover-inverse/pressed-inverse)", "note": "밝은 배경(hover/pressed)과 어두운 배경(hover-inverse/pressed-inverse) 양쪽에 쓰는 유일한 4상태 계열" },
